    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3072" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκέντ-ριστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			= foreg. <i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">Hsch.,
				<u>EM</u>432.11</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stingless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηφῆνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					552c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				564b
			</span></i>; <i>without spur</i>, of a cock, Clyt.<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>; <i>without thorns</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.91
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not responding to the spur</i>, of horses, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				105
			</span></i>: metaph., of style, <i>pointless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				21.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not occupying a cardinal point</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				5.108
			</span></i>, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				89.30
			</span></i>.</div>
